  "description": "The GB-2 is a real stand out. A 650b folding gravel bike with concealed LockJaw hinges on an aluminum frame, the bike also features low gearing, disc brakes and drop bars. The folding convenience makes this bike easier to transport and stow, which opens up additional possibilities for outdoor adventures.\n\nFrame the Adventure\n\nFeaturing a classic diamond frame, this lightweight aluminum bike boasts thick tubes for added stability and a sleek, sophisticated finish.\n\nD4D Adjustable Handlebar\n\nStrong and stylish, this patented stem allows tool-free height and angle adjustments. Rotate 90 degrees for quick storage, adapting easily to your riding style.\n\nSecure Joints, Effortless Operation\n\nThis patented hinge features concealed joints with precision teeth for a tight fit. Enjoy an extremely strong locking force and fast, simple tool operation for reliable performance.\n\nCrankset\n\nDurable for road performance.\n\nFoldable: Travel-Friendly Dimensions\n\nThe flagship model of the Explorer series folds down to 80L x 36W x 66H (cm), making it perfect for various terrains and adventures, easily fitting into your life on the go.",
